<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rēĭcŭlus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rējĭcŭlus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		reicio; in econom. lang., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that is to be rejected</i>, <i>refuse</i>, <i>useless</i>, <i>worthless.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 2, 7</span></i>
			; Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 168, 2 sq.</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. R. R. 2, 1, 24</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vaccae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 5, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mancipia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 47</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies,</span>”
				i. e. <i>spent uselessly</i>, <i>lost</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Brev. Vit. 7, 4</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. Q. N. 7, 32</span></i>.</div>
